  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-20T22:36:26.973Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would allow worlds to do a lot more if we could Instantiate objects over network to players and have them sync. This would be more efficient and easier to work with than having all possible objects in a object pool.",
